#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:2
msgid "Workspace Tools in Settings"
msgstr "设置中的工作区工具"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:4
msgid ""
"Several Settings pages control how Studio prepares and maintains project "
"workspaces. They do not replace the normal workspace and session "
"controls; they define reusable defaults for them."
msgstr "多个设置页面控制 Studio 如何准备和维护项目工作区。它们不会替代普通的工作区和会话控件，而是为这些控件定义可复用的默认值。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:9
msgid "Development environments"
msgstr "开发环境"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:11
msgid ""
"An environment profile is a named setup for a project or managed "
"worktree. It can contain:"
msgstr "环境配置文件是项目或托管 worktree 的命名设置。它可以包含："

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:14
msgid "a setup script that prepares dependencies or generated files;"
msgstr "准备依赖或生成文件的设置脚本；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:15
msgid "whether the setup may use the network;"
msgstr "设置是否可以使用网络；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:16
msgid "named terminal actions for common tasks;"
msgstr "用于常见任务的命名终端操作；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:17
msgid "whether each action may use the network."
msgstr "每个操作是否可以使用网络。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:19
msgid ""
"Use **Settings > Environments** to create or edit a profile for a source "
"folder. Before trusting it, read every script and command. Studio "
"describes the sandbox: with network disabled, scripts can write only to "
"the worktree and isolated cache; with network enabled, the script can "
"reach the network while the filesystem boundary still applies."
msgstr "使用 **Settings > Environments** 为源文件夹创建或编辑配置文件。信任前请阅读每个脚本和命令。Studio 会说明沙箱范围：禁用网络时，脚本只能写入 worktree 和隔离缓存；启用网络时，脚本可以访问网络，但文件系统边界仍然适用。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:25
msgid ""
"Trusting an environment allows its commands to be used as intended. It "
"does not make every command in the project trustworthy, and it does not "
"grant the agent permission to leave the workspace."
msgstr "信任环境可以按预期使用其中的命令。但这不会让项目中的每条命令都变得可信，也不会授予 agent 离开工作区的权限。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:30
msgid "Git worktrees"
msgstr "Git worktree"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:32
msgid ""
"A Git worktree is a second checkout of the same repository. It lets you "
"keep one session's experiment separate from the files in your main "
"checkout."
msgstr "Git worktree 是同一仓库的第二个检出副本。它可以让一个会话的实验与主检出中的文件保持分离。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:35
msgid "Use **Settings > Worktrees** to:"
msgstr "使用 **Settings > Worktrees**："

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:37
msgid "choose the root directory where managed worktrees are created;"
msgstr "选择创建托管 worktree 的根目录；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:38
msgid "restore the default worktree root;"
msgstr "恢复默认 worktree 根目录；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:39
msgid "fetch and prune remotes before creating a worktree;"
msgstr "创建 worktree 前获取并清理远程分支；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:40
msgid "set a limit for managed session worktrees;"
msgstr "设置托管会话 worktree 的数量限制；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:41
msgid "automatically remove old archived managed worktrees;"
msgstr "自动移除旧的已归档托管 worktree；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:42
msgid "inspect managed, permanent, and orphaned worktrees;"
msgstr "检查托管、永久和孤立 worktree；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:43
msgid "repair a worktree registration or create/delete a permanent worktree."
msgstr "修复 worktree 注册，或创建/删除永久 worktree。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:45
msgid ""
"Automatic cleanup removes old managed session worktrees first. Permanent "
"worktrees are not removed automatically. Deletion requires a clean "
"worktree with no active task or terminal and no unnamed commits, so save "
"or commit anything you need before deleting it."
msgstr "自动清理会优先移除旧的托管会话 worktree。永久 worktree 不会自动移除。删除要求 worktree 干净，没有活动任务或终端，也没有未命名提交，因此删除前请保存或提交需要保留的内容。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:51
msgid "Hooks"
msgstr "Hook"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:53
msgid ""
"Hooks are lifecycle commands stored in a project or user configuration. "
"They can run when a project or session event occurs, so treat a Hook as a"
" script that may execute without you typing a terminal command at that "
"moment."
msgstr "Hook 是存储在项目或用户配置中的生命周期命令。它们可以在项目或会话事件发生时运行，因此应将 Hook 视为可能在你没有输入终端命令时执行的脚本。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:57
msgid ""
"In **Settings > Hooks** you can choose a configuration source, create a "
"template, format or reload the JSON, review configured commands, and "
"inspect recent Hook runs. Saving a file never trusts commands "
"automatically. Review each event, matcher, failure policy, and permission"
" scope, then trust only the commands you recognize."
msgstr "在 **Settings > Hooks** 中，你可以选择配置来源、创建模板、格式化或重新加载 JSON、审查已配置命令，并检查最近的 Hook 运行。保存文件不会自动信任命令。请审查每个事件、匹配器、失败策略和权限范围，只信任你认识的命令。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:63
msgid ""
"Studio shows the Hook sandbox in the review panel: the target source "
"folder is writable, other sources are read-only, and network access is "
"disabled unless the configuration explicitly permits it. A Hook's "
"fingerprint helps you notice when its command changed. If the JSON is "
"invalid, fix it in the editor before trying to enable the Hook."
msgstr "Studio 会在审查面板中显示 Hook 沙箱：目标源文件夹可写，其他源只读，除非配置明确允许，否则网络访问会被禁用。Hook 指纹可以帮助你注意到命令发生了变化。JSON 无效时，请先在编辑器中修复，再尝试启用 Hook。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:70
msgid "Godot Projects"
msgstr "Godot Projects"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Settings > Godot Projects** is the project-level view of the Bridge "
"plugin. Use **Add project** or **Rescan** to let Studio find projects, "
"then inspect the Godot version, plugin version, and status for each "
"project."
msgstr "**Settings > Godot Projects** 是 Bridge 插件的项目级视图。使用 **Add project** 或 **Rescan** 让 Studio 查找项目，然后检查每个项目的 Godot 版本、插件版本和状态。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:76
msgid "Common statuses mean:"
msgstr "常见状态的含义："

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:78
msgid "**Not installed** — the Bridge is not present;"
msgstr "**Not installed** — Bridge 不存在；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:79
msgid "**Current** — the bundled plugin matches the Studio release;"
msgstr "**Current** — 随附插件与 Studio 版本匹配；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:80
msgid "**Outdated** or **Modified** — review before upgrading or repairing;"
msgstr "**Outdated** 或 **Modified** — 升级或修复前请审查；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Pending** or **Waiting for Godot** — Studio is waiting for Godot to "
"close;"
msgstr "**Pending** 或 **Waiting for Godot** — Studio 正在等待 Godot 关闭；"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:82
msgid "**Failed** — the operation needs attention or a retry."
msgstr "**Failed** — 操作需要处理或重试。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:84
msgid ""
"Use **Install**, **Upgrade**, **Upgrade all**, **Repair**, **Uninstall**," 
" or **Retry pending** only after checking which projects are selected. "
"Plugin changes are staged safely and may apply after all Godot editors "
"exit."
msgstr "确认选中了哪些项目后，再使用 **Install**、**Upgrade**、**Upgrade all**、**Repair**、**Uninstall** 或 **Retry pending**。插件变更会安全暂存，可能会在所有 Godot 编辑器退出后应用。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:89
msgid "Offline documentation"
msgstr "离线文档"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:91
msgid ""
"The Documentation page installs or imports a local ``godot-docs`` source "
"and builds a searchable local index. You can download an official branch "
"from the Godot documentation repository or choose an extracted "
"directory/ZIP archive. The original local source is not modified."
msgstr "Documentation 页面会安装或导入本地 ``godot-docs`` 源，并构建可搜索的本地索引。你可以从 Godot 文档仓库下载官方分支，也可以选择解压后的目录或 ZIP 压缩包。原始本地源不会被修改。"

#: ../../source/settings/workspace-tools.rst:96
msgid ""
"Use **Check index** to verify SQLite integrity, metadata, counts, and "
"hashes. Use **Repair index** when the status is degraded or unavailable. "
"Repair may use a previous healthy index, a cached source, a local source,"
" or a confirmed network download. Studio validates the rebuilt index "
"before activating it."
msgstr "使用 **Check index** 验证 SQLite 完整性、元数据、数量和哈希。状态降级或不可用时，使用 **Repair index**。修复可能使用之前健康的索引、缓存源、本地源或已确认的网络下载。Studio 会在激活前验证重建的索引。"
